s About Us Wellbeing Medical Services Mental Health and Counseling Prevention and Health Promotion Victim Support Services Get Involved Transition of Care Required Forms, Records and Billing About Us Support & Advocacy Blue Hen Essentials Community Standards & Conflict Resolution Disability Support Services Student Advocacy & Support Student Services for Athletes Veteran and Military Connected Students Victim Support Services Orientations New Student Orientation Flex Pathway NSO UD Welcome Days Parents and Family Engagement Frequently Asked Questions About Us Career Center Career Fairs and Events Career Development Support Resources by Audience Resources by College Search for Jobs and Internships For Employers About Us News About Student Life Strategic Planning Student Success & Thriving Meet Our Team Join Our Team Communications and Marketing Student Life Assessment, Data Analytics & Research UD Home Current Students Career Center UD Career Center Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub Career & Post-Graduate Success Career Fairs and Events Career Development Support Appointments and Drop-Ins Career Access & Mobility Exploring Majors Funding and Grants Generative AI for Career Preparation Interviewing Job Shadow Program Life Design Networking Resumes and Cover Letters Resources by Audience For Alumni ⇲ For Faculty and Staff For Graduate and Postdoctoral Students For Registered Student Organizations Resources by College Agriculture and Natural Resources Arts and Sciences Business and Economics Earth, Ocean and Environment Education and Human Development Engineering Health Sciences Public Policy and Administration Search for Jobs and Internships For Employers About Us Handshake Login UD Student Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub Powered by the UD Career Center The UD Career Center integrates life design, career education and preparation, professional connections, internships and mentoring into the academic, advising and co-curricular undergraduate and graduate student experience. Our goal is to ensure purposeful, equitable and sustained post-graduate success for all Blue Hens. Connect With Us General Questions: udcareers@udel.edu Employer Questions: hireahen@udel.edu Lerner Career Services Questions: lernercareerservices@udel.edu Top Resources Attend Career Fairs or Meetups Build your resume or cover letter Attend drop-in hours Search for jobs and internships Design Your Path to Career Success Success is a journey you define, not a single destination. Discover how your career can align with your values, interests and life by exploring resources tailored to your career readiness stage. Life Design, the primary framework used at the UD Career Center, helps individuals create a fulfilling and purpose-driven life. Where are you in your career journey? Explore different paths and imagine what your future could look like. Discovering What's Possible Think about what you want to try next and start shaping your own story. Designing My Next Chapter Take a small step toward your goals and see where it leads you. Launching My Next Move Learn more about the Life Design framework Other Career Support Offices on Campus Lerner Career Services Career Readiness for Student-Athletes Additional Campus Career Resources\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t> The Career Center is on Canvas The UD Career Center Canvas is your crash course in all things career! Find tips for preparing for career fairs, building your professional network and finding jobs and internships. Browse topics at your speed and access information anytime, anywhere. Learn more about our Canvas modules Handshake Your one-stop shop for off-campus jobs and other career resources. Search for off-campus jobs and internships Make a career appointment Sign up for career communities Log into Handshake 2025–2026 Highlights Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 10,941 Undergraduate students using Canvas Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 1,101,851 Canvas content views Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 271,573 unique positions posted in Handshake Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 14,438 employers in Handshake Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 4,943 Big Interview users Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 159 recipients of career advancement awards Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware $394,827 received in career advancement awards Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 178 enrollments in Forage platform Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 4,768 student-employment engagement through Career Fairs and Meetups Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 6,154 students used Handshake Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 13 Career Fairs and Meetups Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware 108,349 Handshake job and internship applications Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware $8,450 awarded to faculty/staff to create career development activities Career and Post-Graduate Success Hub | Division of Student Life | University of Delaware $15,300 earned by students completing micro-internships Career Center News From Classroom Project to Community Impact October 28, 2025 | Written by Tracey Mulveny Senior Lands Agilent Internship On Handshake July 18, 2025 | Written by Jessica Downey From YWCA Intern to Goodwill Grant Writer February 21, 2025 | Written by Jessica Downey Hospitality at the Hyatt November 15, 2024 | Written b